  <ItemGroup>
    <!-- Telerik.UI.for.AspNet.Core.Trial / Kendo.DynamicLinq / Kendo.DynamicLinqCore 2020.2.617-era are no
         longer available via NuGet (retired by Telerik). Referencing assemblies directly from a salvaged
         copy of the original build output. -->
